  "details": "I use vrchat as a platform for me to take pictures of world I find. With the removal of mod support I've lost access to mods that I used to help get some of these shots.\nI was hoping we could get some official support for some of these features I used.\nFreezeframe Mod - Having a client side version of freezeframe mod that creates snapshots of people was a really useful feature for getting difficult shots. The mod only worked client side unless connected to a server with an additional mod and was really well optimised.\nFlight - I'd suggest probably only allowing this feature in private instances, it avoids the disruption is causes in public instances.",
